      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>Here’s a first draft of a brief liturgy for last night, for solstice plus Ḥanukkah. Note that this is a kind of eco-liturgy, but it also stands on its own without imposing an ecological overlay. Since it’s still solstice all day, you may want to use this prayer now, or at dusk tonight:</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
